              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Deb Brown"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Delicious! I made the red potatoes and onion (I added 3/4 of a vidalia onion) with the corned beef in the slow cooker then took them out and mashed and chopped them (one less pot). I used bacon. I sauteed the cabbage and bacon together to save time. Sprinkled the scallion on top when serving. Great comfort food!",
